<h1>Trades</h1>
<p class="wip-badge">Work in progress</p>
<p>
  Not yet extracted. Wandering traders each specialize in one category (furniture, survival
  goods, building materials, luxuries, commodities, clothing, agriculture, treasure hunting,
  artisan goods) and buy/sell a fixed list of items at a price range, with their own dialogue and
  character model.
</p>
<p class="muted">
  Source data: <code>assets/survival/config/tradelists/*.json</code> (one file per trader
  specialization, listing buy/sell items and price ranges), cross-referenced with
  <code>assets/survival/entities/humanoid/trader-{male,female}.json</code> (which specialization
  each trader entity uses) and <code>assets/survival/config/dialogue/trader.json</code> (trader
  dialogue tree).
</p>
